<title>USA: MGIC Investment Corp Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>MGIC Investment Corp Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>MILWAUKEE 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.21		    $0.98</p>
<p> Net			 72,436		   58,460</p>
<p> Revs		     205,091		  174,637</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  59,661		   59,408</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q1 net premiums earned $170.3 million vs $144.6 million.</p>
<p>Q1 net premiums written $155.6 million vs $123.5 million.</p>
<p>Q1 realized gains $89,000 vs $339,000.</p>
